On Tue, 30 Sep 1997, Christopher McCrory wrote:

> Date: Tue, 30 Sep 1997 13:51:34 -0700
> From: Christopher McCrory <chrismcc@netus.com>
> To: "axp-list@redhat.com" <axp-list@redhat.com>
